# NO torch, NO torchvision, NO easyocr, NO docling.
#
# The slim dataprep carries NO local model: the document conversion is
# delegated to a remote docling-serve (DOCLING_ENDPOINT), the labelling to
# the remote vLLM and the embeddings to the remote TEI — the same shape as
# the slim reranker and the slim retriever, which call their endpoints and
# hold nothing. The local converter (docling + easyocr) is a torch stack,
# and it is only built when DOCLING_ENDPOINT is empty
# (genieai_dataprep_utils.py) — a slim image without that endpoint has no
# local converter and says so.
#
# `transformers` stays: langchain-huggingface imports it eagerly, and it
# works without torch (tokenizers and configuration only).

# === OpenTelemetry instrumentation (distributed tracing) ===
